        <mxCell id="jBHuxOUTavPS6sszCCvF-377" value="Workspace Access" style="html=1;overflow=block;blockSpacing=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11.7;fontFamily=Museo Sans 500;align=left;spacing=3.8;verticalAlign=middle;strokeOpacity=0;fillOpacity=0;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=9;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=NaN;lucidId=41gDoUV10IYh;container=0;" parent="jBHuxOUTavPS6sszCCvF-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1306" y="1645" width="121" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jBHuxOUTavPS6sszCCvF-378" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;Leverage metadata-driven control framework for orchestration, modeling, table maintenance, data refresh, and logging activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;Read data from silver using shortcut.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;Transform and prepare data using Spark notebooks. Notebooks provide flexibility for developers to use the language native to them (PySpark, SparkSQL, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;Read data from silver using pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt;&quot;&gt;Transform and prepare data using warehouse SQL analytics endpoint. Create shortcut from warehouse to lakehouse (optional).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Define joins, create measures calculation groups, and implement additional granular security within&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;semantic models as an extension of lakehouse/warehouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;delta tables.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Semantic models may be created as Direct Lake, Import, or Direct Query connections. Certain restrictions my apply that prohibit use of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Direct Lake.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Content creators create reports and dashboards for consumption.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Sync development workspace to git repo in Azure DevOps to commit changes and establish source control.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Feature branches can be created for isolated development workspaces enabling multi-developer workloads.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Content creators clone remote repo to local development environment to capture latest working version.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Commit local development changes to git repo and create pull request to merge changes from feature branch to main branch.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Completing a pull request will&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;trigger the Test / Validate that performs automated tests to validate content before being published.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Build pipeline is then triggered to prepare content for deployment.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Deployment to test and production is facilitated by the release pipeline.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Release to higher environment is gated by a release managers approval(s).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Release pipeline performs deployment from dev. to test by triggering the Fabric / Power BI deployment pipeline.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Testing and QA is performed prior to being released to prod.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Release pipeline performs deployment form test to prod.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;by triggering the Fabric / Power BI deployment pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Workspace App is created and serves as the primary entry point for end-user consumption.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=1;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=18;movable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" parent="jBHuxOUTavPS6sszCCvF-1" vertex="1">
